		<credits>Upper body only. Thorax is the root. Ground axes match the RealSense colour camera: +X right, +Y down, +Z forward, origin at the camera. Derived from the Pose2Sim Rajagopal adaptation. Arm joints were not rewritten. Pelvis and legs are omitted. Gravity is +Y because +Y is down.</credits>
		
		<publications>Pagnon, D., Domalain, M., Reveret, L. (2021). Pose2Sim: An End-to-End Workflow for 3D Markerless Sports Kinematics—Part 1: Robustness. Sensors, 21(19), 6530.</publications>
		
